x735 text "A file starts with zero or more `use \"path.a0\"` lines, relative to the file. The linker loads every used file once, orders them by dependency, and validates the result as one program with one namespace. Cycles are rejected. A function name defined in two files is rejected with both locations. Diagnostics on a linked program name the file and line they belong to."
x736 puts x734 x735
x737 call close x736 
x738 call open x737 10
x739 write x738 4
x740 write x739 2
x741 text "code"
x742 puts x740 x741
