x744 write x743 2
x745 text "use \"ui.a0\"\nuse \"../examples/life.a0\"\nfn page io -> io\na call open p0 5\nb call close a\nret b\nend"
x746 puts x744 x745
x747 call close x746 
x748 call close x747 
x749 call close x748 
